This fixture is DISTRIBUTION-ONLY. It must never be copied to a consumer.

Its subject is scripts/validate-hermetic-consumption.sh, which install.sh does not ship, and its
corpus is this repository's own core/fixtures/: arm C scans every shipped fixture's inputs.decl
and run.sh. On a consumer the validator is absent and the corpus is tests/fixtures/ in the
installed layout, so this fixture could resolve nothing and only pass.

It is also a MUTATION BATTERY: it builds mini distributions in mktemp, each carrying a copy (or
a mutated copy) of the validator and worlds seeded from consumer-machinery-inventory's run.sh.
